<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Rose</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Telltale</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Timeless Youth</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3IpfXGWXrVi7jMgC2QnBUz</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.980" end="00:31.590">Place your conscience on me (it's too heavy, it's too heavy)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.590" end="00:38.550">You've been barking so loud, the whole town knows we're guilty</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.550" end="00:44.340">Been feeding into arrogance, slipping off my skin like the others did</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.340" end="00:48.540" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Sinners and saints lie side by side)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.540" end="00:55.740">Time after time, we wake up dressed in black, but went to bed in white</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.740" end="00:59.340">Because I'm passive-aggressive when I'm alone with myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.340" end="01:03.780">And then I'm downright possessive if I'm with anyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.780" end="01:10.240">You should know by now that I'm a red flag through a rose lens</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.240" end="01:12.020">And I'll let you down again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.020" end="01:14.170" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Down again, down again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.170" end="01:15.820" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(And I'll let you down again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.820" end="01:18.020" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Down again, down again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.020" end="01:19.840" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(And I'll let you down again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.840" end="01:27.840">My head will always be a wishing well (always be a wishing well)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.060" end="01:35.470">You throw a penny in and hope for anything, but nothing ever happens</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.470" end="01:39.400">I'm not your genie in a bottle or a shooting star</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.400" end="01:43.480">All that you'll ever find within me is a Telltale heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.480" end="01:51.020">And I'll keep pounding at your brain from underneath the floorboards</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.020" end="01:55.520">Because I'm passive-aggressive when I'm alone with myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.520" end="01:59.780">And then I'm downright possessive if I'm with anyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.780" end="02:06.380">You should know by now, that I'm a red flag through a rose lens</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.380" end="02:10.200">And I'll let you down again (down again, down again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.200" end="02:14.300">And I'll let you down again (down again, down again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.300" end="02:18.160">And I'll let you down again (down again, down again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.160" end="02:22.230">And I'll let you down again (down again, down again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.230" end="02:24.760">And I'll let you down again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.760" end="02:28.720">(Here I go again) making empty promises</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.720" end="02:32.750">(Here I go again) saving face with all your friends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:32.750" end="02:36.550">(Here I go again) face down when the party ends</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.550" end="02:39.480" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Here I go again, here I go again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.480" end="02:46.970">Because I'm passive-aggressive when I'm alone with myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.970" end="02:54.970">And then I'm downright possessive if I'm with anyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.160" end="02:59.670">Because I'm passive-aggressive when I'm alone with myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:59.670" end="03:03.760">And then I'm downright possessive if I'm with anyone else</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.760" end="03:10.220">You should know by now, that I'm a red flag through a rose lens</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.220" end="03:12.310">And I'll let you down again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.310" end="03:14.350" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Down again, down again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.350" end="03:16.050" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(And I'll let you down again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.050" end="03:18.390" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Down again, down again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:18.390" end="03:20.360">And I'll let you down again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.360" end="03:24.360" /></div></body></tt>